    {
      "title": "Desktop Release Canary v0.4.0",
      "updated": "2026-09-05T17:07:43Z",
      "url": "https://github.com/kzahel/desktop-release-kit/releases/tag/desktop-v0.4.0",
      "notes_html": "<ul>\n<li>Stable catch-up release for installations on the 0.3 Latest train.</li>\n<li>Show native, webview, and sidecar build IDs together.</li>\n<li>Retry a failed relaunch without downloading or installing the update again.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Automated release evidence</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Five signed updater targets validated from <code>latest.json</code>.</li>\n<li>Developer ID signing and notarization validated for both macOS architectures.</li>\n<li>Authenticode signatures validated for Windows NSIS, MSI, and the nested sidecar.</li>\n<li>Linux AppImage, DEB, and RPM packages validated for x86_64 and ARM64.</li>\n<li>Workflow: <a href=\"https://github.com/kzahel/desktop-release-kit/actions/runs/33978842519\">https://github.com/kzahel/desktop-release-kit/actions/runs/33978842519</a></li>\n<li>Commit: <code>6e6cd56f046324a50ddfff6ac18016f6f3fa5c83</code></li>\n<li>Exact hashes: <a href=\"https://github.com/kzahel/desktop-release-kit/releases/download/desktop-v0.4.0/SHA256SUMS\">https://github.com/kzahel/desktop-release-kit/releases/download/desktop-v0.4.0/SHA256SUMS</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Installed old-to-new testbed evidence is recorded separately and is not implied by CI.</p>",
